VERDICT: the v/j label bug + stamp-config mismatch had MASKED a small real benefit. Done
correctly, pansier gives a modest char-acc improvement (best B_600 0.9591, +0.43pp, sig at
char level). Caveats: small, size-sensitive (B_1000 dips), word-acc n.s., 1-of-8 significance
is partly selection. Weak-but-real positive, not net-neutral.
Approach A = mix from trocr-base (600 real + 7000 medical + N stamped pansier).
Approach B = further-FT leader on N stamped pansier + 600 real.
